{"ticker":"PLTR","updated":"2026-10-30T23:06:14Z","profile":{"longName":"Palantir Technologies Inc.","shortName":"Palantir Technologies Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Infrastructure","country":"United States","website":"https://www.palantir.com","fullTimeEmployees":4401,"marketCap":442427080704,"trailingPE":158.71552,"forwardPE":78.33468,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":71.869934,"pegRatio":1.7,"targetMeanPrice":212.50357,"targetHighPrice":265.0,"targetLowPrice":80.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":28,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.928,"earningsGrowth":2.154,"grossMargins":0.84796,"operatingMargins":0.47120997,"profitMargins":0.49005002,"totalRevenue":6155940864,"beta":1.602,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":212.94,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":106.37,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Palantir Technologies Inc. builds and deploys software platforms for the intelligence community to assist in counterterrorism investigations and operations in the United States, the United Kingdom, and internationally. It provides Palantir Gotham integrates with other platforms for defense offerings which enables users to see, understand, and act in the modern battlespace; operations centers to the tactical edge; integrating data from domains and sensors in near real-time; and situational awareness and accelerating operational decision-making, as well as facilitates the hand-off between analysts and operational users, helping operators plan and execute real-world responses to threats that have been identified within the platform. It also offers Palantir Foundry, a platform that helps organizations operate by creating a central operating system for their data; and allows individual users to integrate and analyze the data they need in one place. In addition, it provides Palantir Apollo, a software that delivers software and updates across the business, as well as enables customers to deploy their software virtually in any environment; and Palantir Artificial Intelligence Platform that provides unified access to open-source, self-hosted, and commercial large language models (LLMs) that can transform structured and unstructured data into LLM-understandable objects and can turn orga","summary_zh":"Palantir Technologies Inc. 為情報界建構和部署軟體平台，以協助美國、英國和國際上的反恐調查和行動。它提供 Palantir Gotham 與其他國防產品平台的集成，使用戶能夠在現代戰場空間中看到、理解並採取行動；作戰中心到戰術邊緣；近乎實時地集成來自域和傳感器的數據；和態勢感知並加速運營決策，並促進分析師和運營用戶之間的交接，幫助運營商計劃和執行對平台內已識別的威脅的實際響應。它還提供 Palantir Foundry，這是一個透過為數據創建中央作業系統來幫助組織運營的平台；並允許個人用戶在一個地方整合和分析他們需要的數據。此外，它還提供 Palantir Apollo，這是一種在整個企業範圍內提供軟體和更新的軟體，並使客戶能夠在任何環境中虛擬部署其軟體； Palantir 人工智慧平台，提供對開源、自託管和商業大語言模型 (LLM) 的統一訪問，可以將結構化和非結構化資料轉換為 LLM 可理解的對象，並可以將組織轉化為","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 基礎設施","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":151.2,"h":158.39,"l":150.28,"c":157.09,"v":65435000},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":158.0,"h":161.15,"l":152.71,"c":154.9,"v":66052300},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":154.865,"h":157.04,"l":153.16,"c":156.14,"v":53292300},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":157.82,"h":158.97,"l":148.04,"c":153.11,"v":81855900},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":154.91,"h":158.3,"l":154.84,"c":156.1,"v":47643000},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":157.25,"h":162.75,"l":156.37,"c":162.36,"v":61359500},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":166.0,"h":169.0,"l":163.44,"c":166.74,"v":62211400},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":167.24,"h":167.458,"l":163.22,"c":164.36,"v":42025500},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":165.35,"h":171.53,"l":164.01,"c":171.43,"v":54498500},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":169.6,"h":171.8,"l":167.41,"c":171.21,"v":45396100},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":171.04,"h":171.31,"l":168.96,"c":170.26,"v":34598700},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":169.02,"h":169.68,"l":161.27,"c":168.33,"v":69255500},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":170.27,"h":178.8,"l":169.39,"c":176.97,"v":70768600},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":177.07,"h":184.42,"l":176.71,"c":182.39,"v":109129900},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":180.88,"h":182.25,"l":178.29,"c":179.33,"v":45916700},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":182.51,"h":185.75,"l":177.01,"c":182.55,"v":62354800},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":183.91,"h":184.85,"l"